---

<BaseLayout
  title="Birthday AI Rap Video Prompts: Scene Bars for Duo Clips"
  description="Birthday AI rap video prompts for duo booth clips: scene structure, original toast-style bars, photo prep, and negatives — a template guide, not a paid video generator."
  canonicalPath="/birthday-ai-rap-video-prompts/"
>
  <JsonLd data={[articleLd, breadcrumbLd, faqLd]} />
  <article class="prose hero">
    <p class="tag">Long-tail guide · Scene prompts</p>
    <h1>Birthday AI rap video prompts</h1>
    <p class="lead">A <strong>birthday AI rap video</strong> search usually wants a short duo booth clip that toasts someone — not another credit-metered generator. This page gives you the scene prompt structure and original birthday bars direction. Paste into your own image-to-video model. This wiki does not render and is not a paid outpainting tool.</p>

    <h2>Scene structure (keep the booth, change the bars)</h2>
    <ol class="list">
      <li><strong>Cast.</strong> Birthday person on one side, friend/partner on the other — or self-duo with two outfits. Consent first.</li>
      <li><strong>Stage.</strong> Same booth language as the <a href="/prompts/ai-rap-video-duo-prompt/">duo template</a>: hanging mic, warm key light, locked two-shot, 8-12 second loop.</li>
      <li><strong>Lyric block.</strong> Swap generic flex bars for toast-style call-and-response: hook names the occasion, verse names one real shared memory (permissioned).</li>
      <li><strong>Negatives.</strong> Keep identity-swap, karaoke text, celebrity lookalike, and NSFW out via the <a href="/prompts/ai-rap-video-negative-prompt-guide/">negative prompt guide</a>.</li>
    </ol>

    <h2>Original birthday bars — direction, not a commercial song</h2>
    <p>Use the <a href="/prompts/ai-rap-video-original-lyrics-prompt/">original lyrics prompt</a> as the skeleton. Fill slots like this (write your own lines; do not copy protected songs):</p>
    <pre class="prompt-box">Hook (4 lines): name the birthday + one warm boast about the year.
Verse A (4 bars, left): one permissioned shared memory + a toast.
Verse B (4 bars, right): answer with a future wish + call back to the hook.
End: both land a clean two-shot hold so the clip loops.</pre>
    <p>Keep names and stories accurate and kind. If the birthday person would not want a detail public, leave it out.</p>

    <h2>Photo prep for celebration clips</h2>
    <ul class="list">
      <li>Front-lit portraits, eyes visible, matched head size — see the <a href="/prompts/ai-rap-video-photo-prep-checklist/">photo prep checklist</a>.</li>
      <li>Party hats and heavy props in source photos often confuse identity; keep source photos plain and let the prompt add stage energy.</li>
      <li>Vertical 9:16 if the gift is a TikTok/Reels/Shorts post — the <a href="/prompts/ai-rap-video-vertical-tiktok-prompt/">vertical template</a> bakes safe headroom.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Related templates</h2>
    <ul class="list">
      <li><a href="/prompts/ai-rap-video-duo-prompt/">Duo prompt</a> — base booth performance</li>
      <li><a href="/prompts/ai-rap-video-best-friends-duo/">Best friends duo</a> — when the second performer is a close friend</li>
      <li><a href="/prompts/ai-rap-video-couple-prompt/">Couple prompt</a> — partner toast variant</li>
      <li><a href="/prompts/ai-rap-video-original-lyrics-prompt/">Original lyrics prompt</a> — safe bar structure</li>
      <li><a href="/prompts/ai-rap-video-photo-prep-checklist/">Photo prep checklist</a> · <a href="/prompts/ai-rap-video-negative-prompt-guide/">Negative prompts</a></li>
      <li><a href="/how-to-make-ai-rap-video/">How-to workflow</a> · <a href="/examples/">Examples</a></li>
    </ul>

    <VideoGallery
      videos={videosFor('birthday')}
      heading="Duo workflow references for celebration clips"
      sub="Same two-photo booth pipeline — swap in birthday bars, keep the stage language."
      viewAll={true}
    />

    <h2>FAQ</h2>
    {faqs.map((f) => (<div><h3>{f.q}</h3><p>{f.a}</p></div>))}

    <div class="notice"><strong>Scene prompts only.</strong> This page is not a birthday video generator. Original toast bars and consenting faces; never bind Hotel Lobby audio or celebrity likenesses. This site does not render.</div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
